  "events": [
    {
      "text": "A small sun on indigo. Inspired by Virginia Tech’s persimmon guide, I will imagine one orange fruit, folded olive calyx and a loose leaf on indigo linen. Goal: overlapping filled planes, tapered leaf tips and one restrained reflection; compare color contrast with raised paint texture.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 11700,
      "afterStroke": 0
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "Four long washes establish cool linen, but bright bands separate them. Crosswise veils will close those gaps before the fruit is placed.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 6000,
      "afterStroke": 4
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "The crossing washes still leave a regular light grid. Diagonal veils should break that rhythm; keep the fruit warmer and more opaque than its setting.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 6500,
      "afterStroke": 8
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "The diagonal veils dimmed the grid. I will place the contact shadow directly under the fruit, then fill its lower body with overlapping orange planes.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 6500,
      "afterStroke": 12
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "The body reads round but the first passes left a narrow blue interior slit. Cross it with broad vertical midtones, then give the right side a quieter warm shadow.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 7540,
      "afterStroke": 16
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 20
    },
    {
      "text": "The slit is closed. Left light and right shadow now separate, though their ends form patches. Broader neighboring planes will connect them before the calyx.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 6500,
      "afterStroke": 20
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 24
    },
    {
      "text": "Neighboring midtones connected the fruit planes; the bristle pattern stays regular. Four unequal tapered calyx lobes will give the crown a botanical shape without outlining the orange.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 7020,
      "afterStroke": 24
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 28
    },
    {
      "text": "The tapered lobes meet clearly, but look like a flat cross. A short stem and selective fold lights should give the crown depth.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 6000,
      "afterStroke": 28
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 32
    },
    {
      "text": "The stem lifts the crown, while the narrow fold lights are subtle. A separate fallen leaf will answer the fruit’s roundness with a long tapered gesture.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 6760,
      "afterStroke": 32
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 36
    },
    {
      "text": "The fallen leaf is filled and tapers, but the pale gap at its tip competes with the fruit. Quiet that window and two left-edge gaps with transparent linen washes.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 7540,
      "afterStroke": 36
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 40
    },
    {
      "text": "The outer windows are dimmer. The fruit still needs clearer upper-left illumination: use a loaded broad shoulder plane and a short warm turn, keeping the lower right subdued.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 7280,
      "afterStroke": 40
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 44
    },
    {
      "text": "Loaded shoulder paint reads more clearly. The fruit floats slightly above the first shadow; connect a short contact directly to its lowest edge, then soften the surrounding cloth.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 7280,
      "afterStroke": 44
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 48
    },
    {
      "text": "The shorter contact now sits against the base instead of forming a distant stripe. Give the loose leaf one broken midrib and two unequal side veins, with a small folded crown light.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 8320,
      "afterStroke": 48
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 52
